# Varangerhalvøya national park, Finnmark: an Arctic plateau, flat and
# endless. Its official extent (Miljødirektoratet's protected-area
# register). Far east, so UTM 33 eastings past 1,000 km. EPSG:25833 metres,
# on the 2 km tile grid (782 tiles).
WEST=1022000
SOUTH=7848000
EAST=1090000
NORTH=7894000
